flowchart TD
    X["Question x from the user"] --> E["Endpoint encodes x itself<br/>F32, times 2^13, round half away from zero"]
    O["Server's claimed outputs<br/>3 field elements"] --> K["Endpoint checks each is canonical<br/>32 bytes little-endian, below q"]
    E --> I["Public instances<br/>endpoint's inputs, then server's outputs"]
    K --> I
    I --> V{"EZKL verify<br/>pinned vk, settings, SRS"}
    PR["Server's proof<br/>exactly 3,072 bytes"] --> V
    V -->|"valid"| D["Decode outputs<br/>signed value divided by 2^26"]
    V -->|"invalid"| N["unavailable"]
    D --> Y["Release y to the user"]
